0 !LDRAW_ORG Unofficial_Model
0 // Original stock-part pantograph; mounting layout adapted from corrected Quickstroke.
0 // Horizontal experiment. One SPIKE Prime hub, one medium angular motor on port A.
0 // O=(0,0), S=(160,-40), crank r=40 LDU; E=2C in the XZ plane.
0 // No hidden constraints, prescribed trajectories, embedded drawing or custom part geometry.
